[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2729149535","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104260#issuecomment-2729149535","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104260","id":2729149535,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6iq4Rf","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T11:31:10Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T11:42:03Z","body":"Tested with Firefox 136.0.1 on macOS, issue is reproducible:\n\nErrors in the console:\n```\nWebGL warning: compressedTexImage: 250 is never a valid width for level 0, because it implies a base mip width of 250. COMPRESSED_RGBA_S3TC_DXT5_EXT requires that base mip levels have a width multiple of 4.\n\nWebGL warning: compressedTexImage: 125 is never a valid width for level 1, because it implies a base mip width of 250. COMPRESSED_RGBA_S3TC_DXT5_EXT requires that base mip levels have a width multiple of 4.\n```\n\nWorks fine if tree texture is resized to 256×256 (currently 260×250) and reimported.\n\nFor the reference, this is documented limitation for [WEBGL_compressed_texture_s3tc](https://registry.khronos.org/webgl/extensions/WEBGL_compressed_texture_s3tc/):\n\n> width << level and height << level must be a multiple of 4.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2729149535/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2729253876","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/104260#issuecomment-2729253876","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104260","id":2729253876,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6irRv0","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-17T12:09:50Z","updated_at":"2025-03-17T12:09:50Z","body":"The issue seems to be specific to new `BetsyCompressor` (texture compression on GPU), it's not checking the texture size, old software compressor do.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2729253876/reaction